%% W3D6 — Hierarchical Subagent Teams — Request Flow
%% Shows full lifecycle: goal ingestion → decomposition → parallel lead dispatch
%% → worker execution → tier aggregation → final assembly
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant LeadA as Team Lead A
    participant LeadB as Team Lead B
    participant W1 as Worker A1
    participant W2 as Worker A2
    participant W3 as Worker B1
    participant LLM as LLM Endpoint

    User->>Orch: Submit goal + task spec
    Note over Orch: Tier 1 — Goal Ingestion
    Orch->>LLM: Decompose goal into SubtaskSpecs
    LLM-->>Orch: TaskPlan (subtask list with lead assignments)

    Note over Orch,LeadB: Parallel lead dispatch (async)
    Orch->>LeadA: SubtaskSpec A (domain A only)
    Orch->>LeadB: SubtaskSpec B (domain B only)

    Note over LeadA: Tier 2 — Lead A decomposes subtask
    LeadA->>W1: Atomic instruction A1 (bounded context)
    LeadA->>W2: Atomic instruction A2 (bounded context)

    Note over W1,W2: Tier 3 — Workers execute in parallel
    W1->>LLM: Bounded prompt / tool call
    LLM-->>W1: WorkerResult A1
    W2->>LLM: Bounded prompt / tool call
    LLM-->>W2: WorkerResult A2

    W1-->>LeadA: WorkerResult A1 (typed)
    W2-->>LeadA: WorkerResult A2 (typed)

    alt All workers succeeded
        LeadA->>LLM: Aggregate WorkerResult A1 + A2
        LLM-->>LeadA: Aggregated output
        LeadA-->>Orch: LeadResult A (validated, success=true)
    else Worker A2 failed after retries
        Note over LeadA: Scoped retry — only W2, not full pipeline
        LeadA-->>Orch: LeadResult A (partial=true, success=false)
    end

    Note over LeadB: Tier 2 — Lead B decomposes subtask
    LeadB->>W3: Atomic instruction B1 (bounded context)
    W3->>LLM: Bounded prompt / tool call
    LLM-->>W3: WorkerResult B1
    W3-->>LeadB: WorkerResult B1 (typed)
    LeadB-->>Orch: LeadResult B (validated, success=true)

    Note over Orch: Tier 1 — Final Assembly
    alt All leads succeeded
        Orch->>LLM: Synthesize LeadResult A + LeadResult B
        LLM-->>Orch: Final assembled output
        Orch-->>User: Complete response
    else One or more leads returned partial result
        Orch-->>User: Partial response with warning flag
    end
